# 12. The big picture

The history looks like:

```
Punch cards
    |
    v
Command line
    |
    v
GUI
    |
    v
Mobile touch interface
    |
    v
Voice / AI interfaces
```

Programming evolved together:

```
Assembly
    |
    v
FORTRAN
    |
    v
C
    |
    v
C++
    |
    v
Java
    |
    v
Modern frameworks
```

GUI was not just a prettier screen. It changed **how humans interact with computers** and **how programmers design software**. It introduced event-driven programming, encouraged object-oriented design, and made software much more accessible to society.
